cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use beatnothing, please cite it as below."
title: "beatnothing: a net of cost benchmark for daily equity signals"
authors:
  - family-names: Patil
    given-names: Kaustubh
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-09-17
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/kaustubhspatil/beatnothing"
abstract: >-
  One engine, one bar, one score. Every contestant is scored net of a flat
  transaction cost against an equal weight position in the same point in time
  universe. The score is the Net Edge, the strategy's net Sharpe minus the do
  nothing Sharpe on the same days, with a paired stationary bootstrap interval.
  Ships nine frozen contestants and a monthly forward track.
